load @term/seed/code/automaton/cellular
  find cellular-automaton

# A quantum cellular automaton: a cellular automaton whose cells carry quantum states and whose local update is unitary,
# so the whole array evolves reversibly and coherently, in superposition. It is the discrete model of quantum field
# dynamics, and it is reversible by construction, the quantum analog of the substrate's reversible collide-then-stream
# rule. The form carries the underlying cellular automaton; the unitary local rule is the added structure.
form quantum-cellular-automaton
  link automaton, like cellular-automaton
